      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23WB Interview friends",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section lists the people who may act as an interview friend of\na suspect, offender or volunteer for the purposes of a provision of\nthis Part referring to an interview friend. Different people may act\nas interview friends of a suspect, offender or volunteer for the\npurposes of different provisions of this Part.\n\n(2) Where the suspect, offender or volunteer is a child or an incapable\nperson, the following people may act as interview friends:\n\n(a) a parent, guardian or other person chosen by, or acceptable\nto, the suspect, offender or volunteer;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section lists the people who may act as an interview friend of\na suspect, offender or volunteer for the purposes of a provision of\nthis Part referring to an interview friend. Different people may act\nas interview friends of a suspect, offender or volunteer for the\npurposes of different provisions of this Part.\n\n(2) Where the suspect, offender or volunteer is a child or an incapable\nperson, the following people may act as interview friends:\n\n(a) a parent, guardian or other person chosen by, or acceptable\nto, the suspect, offender or volunteer;",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5e2eb7ed241fa1747f33be2c137d57c40a7d2e71bbd95f738abe3cfc3646e244"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23WB Interview friends",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section lists the people who may act as an interview friend of\na suspect, offender or volunteer for the purposes of a provision of\nthis Part referring to an interview friend. Different people may act\nas interview friends of a suspect, offender or volunteer for the\npurposes of different provisions of this Part.\n\n(2) Where the suspect, offender or volunteer is a child or an incapable\nperson, the following people may act as interview friends:\n\n(a) a parent, guardian or other person chosen by, or acceptable\nto, the suspect, offender or volunteer;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23WB(1) Interview friends",
