      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section lists the people who may act as an interview friend of\na suspect, offender or volunteer for the purposes of a provision of\nthis Part referring to an interview friend. Different people may act\nas interview friends of a suspect, offender or volunteer for the\npurposes of different provisions of this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section lists the people who may act as an interview friend of\na suspect, offender or volunteer for the purposes of a provision of\nthis Part referring to an interview friend. Different people may act\nas interview friends of a suspect, offender or volunteer for the\npurposes of different provisions of this Part.",
      "values:partOf": {
