      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "circumstances\n\nThe following table shows the circumstances in which a forensic\nprocedure may be carried out on a suspect, and shows the\nprovisions that authorise the carrying out of the procedure.\n\nAuthority for forensic procedures\n\nSuspect\nIntimate forensic\nprocedure\nNon-intimate forensic\nprocedure\n1 adult not in custody\nwith informed consent\nunder Division 3\nby order of a\nmagistrate under",
      "skos:definition": "circumstances\n\nThe following table shows the circumstances in which a forensic\nprocedure may be carried out on a suspect, and shows the\nprovisions that authorise the carrying out of the procedure.\n\nAuthority for forensic procedures\n\nSuspect\nIntimate forensic\nprocedure\nNon-intimate forensic\nprocedure\n1 adult not in custody\nwith informed consent\nunder Division 3\nby order of a\nmagistrate under",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wc-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wc-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a8e7da6d25c27ba9e51207803e5448cc7652b4612469806b8a565f3c32035367",
      "skos:note": "Authorises forensic procedures under certain circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23WC How forensic procedures may be authorised in different",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "circumstances\n\nThe following table shows the circumstances in which a forensic\nprocedure may be carried out on a suspect, and shows the\nprovisions that authorise the carrying out of the procedure.\n\nAuthority for forensic procedures\n\nSuspect\nIntimate forensic\nprocedure\nNon-intimate forensic\nprocedure\n1 adult not in custody\nwith informed consent\nunder Division 3\nby order of a\nmagistrate under"
    },
