      "skos:definition": "incapable\nperson not\nin custody\nNot applicable\nNot applicable\nProcedure must be\ncarried out within 2\nhours after suspect\npresents to investigating\nconstable, disregarding\n“dead time” described in\nsubsection 23XGB(2)\n(see section 23XGB).",
