      "values:originalText": "(not\ncovered by\nitem 1 or 2)\nnot in\ncustody\nProcedure must\nbe carried out\nwithin 4 hours\nafter suspect\npresents to\ninvestigating\nconstable,\ndisregarding\n“dead time”\ndescribed in\nsubsection 23WL\nA(2) (see\nsection 23WLA).\nNot applicable\nProcedure must be\ncarried out within 4\nhours after suspect\npresents to investigating\nconstable, disregarding\n“dead time” described in\nsubsection 23XGB(2)\n(see section 23XGB).",
      "skos:definition": "(not\ncovered by\nitem 1 or 2)\nnot in\ncustody\nProcedure must\nbe carried out\nwithin 4 hours\nafter suspect\npresents to\ninvestigating\nconstable,\ndisregarding\n“dead time”\ndescribed in\nsubsection 23WL\nA(2) (see\nsection 23WLA).\nNot applicable\nProcedure must be\ncarried out within 4\nhours after suspect\npresents to investigating\nconstable, disregarding\n“dead time” described in\nsubsection 23XGB(2)\n(see section 23XGB).",
