    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23WG(4) Informed consent to forensic procedures—Aboriginal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wg-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before asking the suspect to consent to a forensic procedure, the\nconstable must:\n\n(a) inform the suspect that a representative of an Aboriginal\nlegal assistance organisation will be notified that the suspect\nis to be asked to consent to a forensic procedure; and\n\n(b) notify such a representative that the suspect is to be asked to\nconsent to a forensic procedure.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Before asking the suspect to consent to a forensic procedure, the\nconstable must:\n\n(a) inform the suspect that a representative of an Aboriginal\nlegal assistance organisation will be notified that the suspect\nis to be asked to consent to a forensic procedure; and\n\n(b) notify such a representative that the suspect is to be asked to\nconsent to a forensic procedure.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "12bf70d36c0d0579ec5ace3174e1e32ee2d3b90646aeb093e476f429d3b4b992",
      "skos:note": "Notify Aboriginal legal assistance organisation of consent request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wg-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23WG(4) Informed consent to forensic procedures—Aboriginal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before asking the suspect to consent to a forensic procedure, the\nconstable must:\n\n(a) inform the suspect that a representative of an Aboriginal\nlegal assistance organisation will be notified that the suspect\nis to be asked to consent to a forensic procedure; and\n\n(b) notify such a representative that the suspect is to be asked to\nconsent to a forensic procedure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wg-ss-4-norm",
