      "values:originalText": "(2) In determining whether the carrying out of the forensic procedure\nwithout consent is justified in all the circumstances, the senior\npolice officer must balance the public interest in obtaining\nevidence tending to confirm or disprove that the suspect committed\nthe offence concerned against the public interest in upholding the\nphysical integrity of the suspect."
    },
