    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wp",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23WP Record of senior police officer’s order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wp"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The senior police officer must, at the time of, or as soon as\npracticable after, make an order under section 23WN, make a\nrecord of:\n\n(a) the order made; and\n\n(b) the date and time when the order was made; and\n\n(c) the reasons for making it;\nand must sign the record.\n\n(2) The senior police officer must ensure that a copy of the record is\nmade available to the suspect as soon as practicable after the record\nis made.\n\n\nForensic procedures  Part ID\nForensic procedures on suspect by order of a magistrate  Division 5\n\nSection 23WQ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The senior police officer must, at the time of, or as soon as\npracticable after, make an order under section 23WN, make a\nrecord of:\n\n(a) the order made; and\n\n(b) the date and time when the order was made; and\n\n(c) the reasons for making it;\nand must sign the record.\n\n(2) The senior police officer must ensure that a copy of the record is\nmade available to the suspect as soon as practicable after the record\nis made.\n\n\nForensic procedures  Part ID\nForensic procedures on suspect by order of a magistrate  Division 5\n\nSection 23WQ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wp-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wp-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9c4781b3d213f40e256d9efa015be13f6ca26e92bbef116d1ce7ff9752ea3e7e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wp",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23WP Record of senior police officer’s order",
      "values:kind": "section",
