      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The senior police officer must ensure that a copy of the record is\nmade available to the suspect as soon as practicable after the record\nis made.\n\n\nForensic procedures  Part ID\nForensic procedures on suspect by order of a magistrate  Division 5\n\nSection 23WQ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The senior police officer must ensure that a copy of the record is\nmade available to the suspect as soon as practicable after the record\nis made.\n\n\nForensic procedures  Part ID\nForensic procedures on suspect by order of a magistrate  Division 5\n\nSection 23WQ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
