      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "magistrate\n\nA person is authorised to carry out a forensic procedure on a\nsuspect by order of a magistrate under section 23WS or 23XA. The\nperson is authorised to carry out the procedure in accordance with\nDivision 6 and not otherwise.",
      "skos:definition": "magistrate\n\nA person is authorised to carry out a forensic procedure on a\nsuspect by order of a magistrate under section 23WS or 23XA. The\nperson is authorised to carry out the procedure in accordance with\nDivision 6 and not otherwise.",
