      "values:originalText": "(2) However, a magistrate is not authorised to order the carrying out of\na forensic procedure on a suspect if the procedure has been\nrequested by a foreign law enforcement agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, a magistrate is not authorised to order the carrying out of\na forensic procedure on a suspect if the procedure has been\nrequested by a foreign law enforcement agency.",
