    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Magistrate must consider the matters.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In balancing those interests, the magistrate must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The magistrate MUST consider the matters."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Matters are considered before ordering a forensic procedure.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In balancing those interests, the magistrate must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The matter >= ordering a forensic procedure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IMPLIES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consideration by the magistrate implies ordering a forensic procedure.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In balancing those interests, the magistrate must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the magistrate considers the matter, then it implies ordering a forensic procedure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IS-A",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consideration by the magistrate is related to forensic procedures.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In balancing those interests, the magistrate must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The consideration IS-A forensic procedure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IS-A",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consideration by the magistrate is a cognitive process.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In balancing those interests, the magistrate must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The consideration IS-A cognitive process."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23WT(4) Matters to be considered by magistrate before ordering",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wt-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the matters that the magistrate may take into\naccount in considering, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(f), the\nintrusiveness of the forensic procedure, the magistrate must (where\nappropriate) take into account the religious beliefs of the suspect.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting the matters that the magistrate may take into\naccount in considering, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(f), the\nintrusiveness of the forensic procedure, the magistrate must (where\nappropriate) take into account the religious beliefs of the suspect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "508f6ef4c804f81f9cf8d35849ac358a10e437a4c71c393bbf23fdb79be7c9f6",
      "skos:note": "Magistrate must consider religious beliefs of suspect in forensic procedure"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23wt-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23WT(4) Matters to be considered by magistrate before ordering",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the matters that the magistrate may take into\naccount in considering, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(f), the\nintrusiveness of the forensic procedure, the magistrate must (where\nappropriate) take into account the religious beliefs of the suspect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23wt-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
