      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23ww-ss-5-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "justifiedBy",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Justification condition for warrant issuance",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The magistrate may issue a warrant only if satisfied:\n\n(a) that the arrest is necessary to ensure the appearance of the\nsuspect at the hearing of the application, and that the issue of\na summons would not ensure that appearance; or\n\n(b) that the suspect might destroy evidence that might be\nobtained by carrying out the forensic procedure; or\n\n(c) that the issue of the warrant is otherwise justified."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23ww-ss-5-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "otherwiseJustifiedBy",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Alternative justification condition for warrant issuance",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The magistrate may issue a warrant only if satisfied:\n\n(a) that the arrest is necessary to ensure the appearance of the\nsuspect at the hearing of the application, and that the issue of\na summons would not ensure that appearance; or\n\n(b) that the suspect might destroy evidence that might be\nobtained by carrying out the forensic procedure; or\n\n(c) that the issue of the warrant is otherwise justified."
    },
