      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(9) In spite of subsection (5) or (6), the suspect’s interview friend may\nbe excluded from the presence of the authorised applicant if the\ninterview friend unreasonably interferes with or obstructs the\nmaking of the application.",
