      "cml:premiseText": "Forensic procedure must be carried out in circumstances affording reasonable privacy to the suspect.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Must not be carried out in the presence or view of a person who is of the opposite sex to the suspect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xi-logic-deontic-2",
