    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23XK Forensic procedures not to be carried out in cruel, inhuman",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23xk"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "or degrading manner\n\nFor the purpose of this Part, the carrying out of a forensic\nprocedure is not of itself taken to be cruel, inhuman or degrading.\nHowever, nothing in this Part authorises the carrying out of a\nforensic procedure in a cruel, inhuman or degrading manner.",
      "skos:definition": "or degrading manner\n\nFor the purpose of this Part, the carrying out of a forensic\nprocedure is not of itself taken to be cruel, inhuman or degrading.\nHowever, nothing in this Part authorises the carrying out of a\nforensic procedure in a cruel, inhuman or degrading manner.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2ad155abab2a18c3852027e06b0502f9d7a6869d2d26468100e8e733271bc1c5",
      "skos:note": "Forensic procedures must not be carried out in cruel, inhuman or degrading manner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23xk",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23XK Forensic procedures not to be carried out in cruel, inhuman",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 63,
      "values:originalText": "or degrading manner\n\nFor the purpose of this Part, the carrying out of a forensic\nprocedure is not of itself taken to be cruel, inhuman or degrading.\nHowever, nothing in this Part authorises the carrying out of a\nforensic procedure in a cruel, inhuman or degrading manner."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23xk"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
