      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.63",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The table following subsection (4) shows, for each forensic\nprocedure, the persons who may carry out the procedure under this\nPart. A person not specified in the second column of the table is",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The table following subsection (4) shows, for each forensic\nprocedure, the persons who may carry out the procedure under this\nPart. A person not specified in the second column of the table is",
      "cml:asserts": [
