      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23xs-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23XS(2) Presence of constables",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 71,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where the presence of a constable (other than a constable who is\ncarrying out or helping to carry out the procedure) is reasonably\nnecessary to ensure that a forensic procedure is carried out\neffectively and in accordance with this Part, the constable is:"
    },
