      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Evidence described in subsection (2) is not admissible if the\nforensic procedure was in fact carried out satisfactorily.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Forensic procedure must be carried out satisfactorily for evidence to be admissible."
    },
