      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an order for the carrying out of a forensic procedure made under\nsection 23XWU or for the retention of forensic material under\nsection 23XWV specifies a period for which forensic material\nobtained as a result of the carrying out of the procedure may be\nretained, the forensic material is to be destroyed as soon as\npracticable after the end of the period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yc-ss-2-norm",
