      "values:originalText": "(4) If a warrant for the apprehension of the suspect is issued during the\nperiod of 12 months after forensic material is taken, the forensic\nmaterial must be destroyed as soon as practicable after:\n\n(a) the warrant lapses; or\n\n(b) a period of 12 months elapses after the suspect is\napprehended."
