    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23YF(3) Obligation of investigating constables relating to tape",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23yf-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If section 23YD requires forensic material taken from a suspect,\noffender or volunteer by a forensic procedure to be destroyed, the\ninvestigating constable must ensure that any video recording of the\ncarrying out of the forensic procedure is also destroyed.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If section 23YD requires forensic material taken from a suspect,\noffender or volunteer by a forensic procedure to be destroyed, the\ninvestigating constable must ensure that any video recording of the\ncarrying out of the forensic procedure is also destroyed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yf-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yf-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23yf-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "449e82de838d8c762bfad43032feb7f7c0f50bbe14e0edd0af37910de0a64db3",
      "skos:note": "Destroy video recording of forensic procedure if section 23YD requires destruction of material."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23yf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23YF(3) Obligation of investigating constables relating to tape",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 116,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If section 23YD requires forensic material taken from a suspect,\noffender or volunteer by a forensic procedure to be destroyed, the\ninvestigating constable must ensure that any video recording of the\ncarrying out of the forensic procedure is also destroyed."
    },
    {
