    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23ZB(4) Forfeiture of material by operation of law",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23zb-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the constable gives the forfeiture notice to a person described in\nsubsection (2), the constable may also give a copy of the notice to\nanyone whom the constable reasonably believes will be directly or\nindirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture of the forfeitable\nthing.\nEffect of giving forfeiture notice",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the constable gives the forfeiture notice to a person described in\nsubsection (2), the constable may also give a copy of the notice to\nanyone whom the constable reasonably believes will be directly or\nindirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture of the forfeitable\nthing.\nEffect of giving forfeiture notice",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zb-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zb-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c392ac10f06cbc41f844c505c4d136469e71d1ae2a2d915a01610ed8ea0e4f70",
      "skos:note": "Give notice to anyone directly or indirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23zb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23ZB(4) Forfeiture of material by operation of law",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the constable gives the forfeiture notice to a person described in\nsubsection (2), the constable may also give a copy of the notice to\nanyone whom the constable reasonably believes will be directly or\nindirectly affected by the proposed forfeiture of the forfeitable\nthing.\nEffect of giving forfeiture notice"
    },
    {
