      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make\nany interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating\nto the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision\n\n\nForfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE\nForfeiture by court order on application  Division 3\n\nSection 23ZD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\non the application, and orders relating to the making and provision\nof copies of things).\nCircumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture",
      "skos:definition": "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make\nany interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating\nto the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision\n\n\nForfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE\nForfeiture by court order on application  Division 3\n\nSection 23ZD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\non the application, and orders relating to the making and provision\nof copies of things).\nCircumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0ec838988b9fccdd65cb623438f2128434a5bd1e0f0c9e6f7ed4c574b0f48791",
      "skos:note": "Court may make interim orders on application for forfeiture of material"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23zd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23ZD(3) Forfeiture of material by court order on application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 144,
      "values:originalText": "(3) At any time after the application is made to the court, it may make\nany interim orders it considers appropriate (such as orders relating\nto the delivery or retention of things pending the court’s decision\n\n\nForfeiture of child abuse material  Part IE\nForfeiture by court order on application  Division 3\n\nSection 23ZD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\non the application, and orders relating to the making and provision\nof copies of things).\nCircumstances that do not prevent court ordering forfeiture"
    },
