    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23ZD(4) Forfeiture of material by court order on application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23zd-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.144",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An order under subsection (1):\n\n(a) may be made even if a person entitled to be given notice of\nthe application fails to appear at the hearing of the\napplication; and\n\n(b) need not be based on a finding as to the commission of a\nparticular Commonwealth child sex offence; and\n\n(c) can be based on a finding that some such offence was\ncommitted; and\n\n(d) need not be based on a finding that a particular person\ncommitted a Commonwealth child sex offence.\nCourt may order compensation for forfeiture",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An order under subsection (1):\n\n(a) may be made even if a person entitled to be given notice of\nthe application fails to appear at the hearing of the\napplication; and\n\n(b) need not be based on a finding as to the commission of a\nparticular Commonwealth child sex offence; and\n\n(c) can be based on a finding that some such offence was\ncommitted; and\n\n(d) need not be based on a finding that a particular person\ncommitted a Commonwealth child sex offence.\nCourt may order compensation for forfeiture",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23zd-ss-4-norm"
