      "skos:note": "Commonwealth liable for compensation in case of forfeiture. The thing becomes property of Commonwealth upon forfeiture."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23ze-ss-2",
