    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-30j-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30J(3) Industrial disturbances, lock-outs and strikes",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 149,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section:\nemployee includes any person whose usual occupation is as an\nemployee.\nemployer includes any person whose usual occupation is as an\nemployer.\nlock-out includes the closing of a place or part of a place of\nemployment, if the closing is unreasonable, and the total or partial\nrefusal of employers, acting in combination, to give work, if the\nrefusal is unreasonable, or the total or partial suspension of work\nby an employer, if the suspension is unreasonable, with a view to"
    },
    {
