      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) Absolute liability applies to the paragraph (1)(b) element of the\noffence.\nNote:\nFor absolute liability, see section 6.2 of the Criminal Code.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) Absolute liability applies to the paragraph (1)(b) element of the\noffence.\nNote:\nFor absolute liability, see section 6.2 of the Criminal Code.",
