    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-41-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41(5) Conspiracy to bring false accusation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-41-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person cannot be found guilty of an offence against\nsubsection (1) if, before the commission of an overt act pursuant to\nthe agreement, the person:\n\n(a) withdrew from the agreement; and\n\n(b) took all reasonable steps to prevent the false charging.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A person cannot be found guilty of an offence against\nsubsection (1) if, before the commission of an overt act pursuant to\nthe agreement, the person:\n\n(a) withdrew from the agreement; and\n\n(b) took all reasonable steps to prevent the false charging.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-41"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-41-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-41-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c9f0cf026a4aa5b514159d4a7bdcefa4dcf8feec3cbd37049696b2af37124bc2",
      "skos:note": "Must take reasonable steps to prevent false charging before committing an overt act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-41-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41(5) Conspiracy to bring false accusation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 160,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person cannot be found guilty of an offence against\nsubsection (1) if, before the commission of an overt act pursuant to\nthe agreement, the person:\n\n(a) withdrew from the agreement; and\n\n(b) took all reasonable steps to prevent the false charging."
    },
