        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) A person may be found guilty of an offence against subsection (1)",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The system recognizes the action of perverting justice as a class"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-44",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "44 Compounding offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-44"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.163",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person:\n\n(i) asks for, receives or obtains any property, or benefit, of\nany kind for himself or herself or another person; or\n\n(ii) agrees to receive or to obtain any property, or benefit, of\nany kind for himself or herself or another person; and\n\n(b) the first person does so upon an agreement or understanding\nthat the first person will:\n\n(i) compound or conceal an offence; or\n\n(ii) abstain from, discontinue or delay a prosecution for an\noffence; or\n\n(iii) withhold evidence of an offence; and",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the first person:\n\n(i) asks for, receives or obtains any property, or benefit, of\nany kind for himself or herself or another person; or\n\n(ii) agrees to receive or to obtain any property, or benefit, of\nany kind for himself or herself or another person; and\n\n(b) the first person does so upon an agreement or understanding\nthat the first person will:\n\n(i) compound or conceal an offence; or\n\n(ii) abstain from, discontinue or delay a prosecution for an\noffence; or\n\n(iii) withhold evidence of an offence; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-44-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-44-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "16ed3ed5bf97e8dd7467f422032a1234eaef004425370b9c9ad145b67df2216f",
      "skos:note": "Agreement to compound or conceal an offence"
    },
    {
