      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "A person must not perform an act of piracy.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for life.",
      "skos:definition": "A person must not perform an act of piracy.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for life.",
