      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) This section applies to acts performed on the high seas..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53(3) Operating a pirate-controlled ship or aircraft",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-53-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.172",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Supreme Court of a State or Territory may:\n\n(a) on the application by the custodian of, or a person with an\ninterest in, a ship, aircraft or thing seized under this section,\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be returned to its lawful\nowner; or\n\n(b) on its own motion, or on application:\n\n(i) if:\n\n(A) a person has been convicted of an offence\nagainst this Part; and\n\n(B) the ship, aircraft or thing was used in, or was\notherwise involved in the commission of, the\noffence;\n\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be forfeited to the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(ii) make any order relating to the seizure, detention or\ndisposal of the ship, aircraft or thing.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Supreme Court of a State or Territory may:\n\n(a) on the application by the custodian of, or a person with an\ninterest in, a ship, aircraft or thing seized under this section,\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be returned to its lawful\nowner; or\n\n(b) on its own motion, or on application:\n\n(i) if:\n\n(A) a person has been convicted of an offence\nagainst this Part; and\n\n(B) the ship, aircraft or thing was used in, or was\notherwise involved in the commission of, the\noffence;\n\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be forfeited to the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(ii) make any order relating to the seizure, detention or\ndisposal of the ship, aircraft or thing.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-53-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8108c9c2f59676d437cf4f7dcd8b4dc117a74ee9518967bff0212740424f04c7",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on operating a pirate-controlled ship or aircraft"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-53-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(3) Operating a pirate-controlled ship or aircraft",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 172,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Supreme Court of a State or Territory may:\n\n(a) on the application by the custodian of, or a person with an\ninterest in, a ship, aircraft or thing seized under this section,\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be returned to its lawful\nowner; or\n\n(b) on its own motion, or on application:\n\n(i) if:\n\n(A) a person has been convicted of an offence\nagainst this Part; and\n\n(B) the ship, aircraft or thing was used in, or was\notherwise involved in the commission of, the\noffence;\n\norder that the ship, aircraft or thing be forfeited to the\nCommonwealth; or\n\n(ii) make any order relating to the seizure, detention or\ndisposal of the ship, aircraft or thing."
    },
