        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "postal message means:\n\n(b) a material record issued by Australia Post as a record of an unwritten communication:\n\n(i) carried by post; or\n\n(ii) collected or received by Australia Post for carriage by post.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "postal message is a material record issued by Australia Post."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85e-logic-descriptionlogic-7",
