      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "(5A) Subsections (3), (4) and (5) do not apply if the person has a\nreasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (5A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "skos:definition": "(5A) Subsections (3), (4) and (5) do not apply if the person has a\nreasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (5A) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
