        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5bb1b592b422d78502e1e0137d14051756a41e6754424bb5e69715a2aec08520",
      "skos:note": "Defines Medical Chest Program"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-85w-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "85W(4) Causing controlled drugs or controlled plants to be carried by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 180,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nMedical Chest Program means the program known under that\nname (or another name determined by the Royal Flying Doctor\nService of Australia) that is:\n\n(a) for the supply of packages of pharmaceutical products and\nmedical supplies to remote locations across Australia; and"
    },
    {
