      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.190",
      "values:originalText": "This Part binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the\nNorthern Territory.\n\n\nPardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC\nPardons for persons wrongly convicted, and quashed convictions  Division 2\n\nSection 85ZR\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "This Part binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the\nNorthern Territory.\n\n\nPardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC\nPardons for persons wrongly convicted, and quashed convictions  Division 2\n\nSection 85ZR\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
