      "skos:note": "Part binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each of the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the Northern Territory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-85zq",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
