      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.191",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to Division 6, but despite any other Commonwealth law or\nany State law or Territory law, where, under section 85ZR, a\nperson is, in particular circumstances or for a particular purpose, to\nbe taken never to have been convicted of an offence:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to Division 6, but despite any other Commonwealth law or\nany State law or Territory law, where, under section 85ZR, a\nperson is, in particular circumstances or for a particular purpose, to\nbe taken never to have been convicted of an offence:",
