    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "85ZY Convictions of further State or foreign offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-85zy"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.196",
      "values:originalText": "Subject to subsection 85ZV(3), where:\n\n\nPardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC\nConvictions of further offences  Division 4\n\nSection 85ZY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of\nwhich the person was convicted, or would so apply to the\nperson if the waiting period for the offence had ended; and\n\n(b) before or after the end of the waiting period for the offence,\nthe person is convicted (whether summarily or on indictment)\nby a court of a State (not being a court exercising federal\njurisdiction) or a court of a foreign country, of another\noffence, being an offence committed during that waiting\nperiod;\nDivision 3 ceases to apply or does not apply to the person, as the\ncase requires, in relation to the earlier offence until the waiting\nperiod for the later offence has ended.",
      "skos:definition": "Subject to subsection 85ZV(3), where:\n\n\nPardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC\nConvictions of further offences  Division 4\n\nSection 85ZY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of\nwhich the person was convicted, or would so apply to the\nperson if the waiting period for the offence had ended; and\n\n(b) before or after the end of the waiting period for the offence,\nthe person is convicted (whether summarily or on indictment)\nby a court of a State (not being a court exercising federal\njurisdiction) or a court of a foreign country, of another\noffence, being an offence committed during that waiting\nperiod;\nDivision 3 ceases to apply or does not apply to the person, as the\ncase requires, in relation to the earlier offence until the waiting\nperiod for the later offence has ended.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-85zy-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9422ddab0f7cce085176ffbef020ebc897322292216abe3e7591d066b9aa2989",
      "skos:note": "Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of which the person was convicted, or would so apply to the person if the waiting period for the offence had ended."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-85zy",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "85ZY Convictions of further State or foreign offences",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 196,
      "values:originalText": "Subject to subsection 85ZV(3), where:\n\n\nPardons, quashed convictions and spent convictions  Part VIIC\nConvictions of further offences  Division 4\n\nSection 85ZY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) Division 3 applies to a person in relation to an offence of\nwhich the person was convicted, or would so apply to the\nperson if the waiting period for the offence had ended; and\n\n(b) before or after the end of the waiting period for the offence,\nthe person is convicted (whether summarily or on indictment)\nby a court of a State (not being a court exercising federal\njurisdiction) or a court of a foreign country, of another\noffence, being an offence committed during that waiting\nperiod;\nDivision 3 ceases to apply or does not apply to the person, as the\ncase requires, in relation to the earlier offence until the waiting\nperiod for the later offence has ended."
    },
