      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.198",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person may complain to the Information Commissioner about an\nact or practice of another person or of a Commonwealth authority\nor State authority that may be a breach of Division 2 or 3.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person may complain to the Information Commissioner about an\nact or practice of another person or of a Commonwealth authority\nor State authority that may be a breach of Division 2 or 3.",
