      "cml:integrityHash": "dd427557680f51dc18261dd2c474101900735b793a8ca1810048e4b218fce34f",
      "skos:note": "Department head is respondent to complaint about act or practice of Department or officer. The Information Commissioner has functions to investigate and try to settle breaches of Division 2 or 3. Right to complain about a breach of Division 2 or 3."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-85zz-ss-1",
