      "values:originalText": "(1) If a complaint is about an act or practice of a Commonwealth\nDepartment or a State Department, or an officer of such a\nDepartment, the Secretary or head of the Department is the\nrespondent to the complaint.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a complaint is about an act or practice of a Commonwealth\nDepartment or a State Department, or an officer of such a\nDepartment, the Secretary or head of the Department is the\nrespondent to the complaint.",
