      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-86b-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "has",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation on Commonwealth bodies",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-86c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "86C Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-86c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.221",
      "values:originalText": "purpose\n\nA target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive\ninformation that:\n\n(a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably\nnecessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities; or\n\n(b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth\ncompany—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities.\nNote:\nSubclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the\ncircumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive\ninformation. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive",
      "skos:definition": "purpose\n\nA target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive\ninformation that:\n\n(a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably\nnecessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities; or\n\n(b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth\ncompany—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities.\nNote:\nSubclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the\ncircumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive\ninformation. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-86c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "457745d1dcb6cdedd20474f35253ac01173b281648b838d3c03dd7d96111a256",
      "skos:note": "Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-86c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "86C Target entity may collect sensitive information for integrity",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 221,
      "values:originalText": "purpose\n\nA target entity may collect for an integrity purpose sensitive\ninformation that:\n\n(a) if the target entity is a Privacy Act agency—is reasonably\nnecessary for, or directly related to, one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities; or\n\n(b) if the target entity is a wholly-owned Commonwealth\ncompany—is reasonably necessary for one or more of the\nentity’s functions or activities.\nNote:\nSubclause 3.3 of Australian Privacy Principle 3 limits the\ncircumstances in which an APP entity may collect sensitive\ninformation. This section lets a target entity collect sensitive"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-86c-norm",
