      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.224",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An authorized Commonwealth officer shall not, under this section,\nrequest a person to furnish his or her name or address, or\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part VIII\n\nSection 89A\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\napprehend a person, unless he or she first produces to the person\nthe instrument by virtue of which he or she is an authorized\nCommonwealth officer.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An authorized Commonwealth officer shall not, under this section,\nrequest a person to furnish his or her name or address, or\n\n\nMiscellaneous  Part VIII\n\nSection 89A\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\napprehend a person, unless he or she first produces to the person\nthe instrument by virtue of which he or she is an authorized\nCommonwealth officer.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
