      "skos:definition": "(1) A person who, without lawful authority or excuse (proof whereof\nshall lie upon him or her), discharges a firearm upon or over a\nprohibited area commits an offence and the firearms shall be\nforfeited to the Commonwealth.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 6 months.",
