      "skos:note": "Discharging firearms on prohibited areas is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-89a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "89A(1) Discharging firearms on or over Commonwealth land",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 225,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person who, without lawful authority or excuse (proof whereof\nshall lie upon him or her), discharges a firearm upon or over a\nprohibited area commits an offence and the firearms shall be\nforfeited to the Commonwealth.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 6 months."
    },
    {
